  "purpose": "<p>The Industry and Regulators Committee was appointed to consider matters relating to industry, including the policies of His Majesty’s Government to promote industrial growth, skills and competitiveness, and to scrutinise the work of UK regulators.</p>\r\n<p>Follow the&nbsp;Committee on <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/industry-and-regulators-committee/\">LinkedIn</a> or <a href=\"https://twitter.com/HLIndustryCom\">X (formerly Twitter).</a></p>",
